  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of a new framework contract aimed at flexible deployment of technical expertise for the MFA Inclusive Green Growth (IGG) and its underlying policy themes. Budgets will be distributed among the thematic clusters.</narrative>
